## Approach

Make title rename the admission boundary and run it before all log-publish work. Scrub-only remains useful to prevent unsafe log flushes, but it cannot block or undo admission. Admission is explicit through `ADMISSION_READY` / `ADMISSION_BLOCK_REASON`; scrub status is separate log-publish state. Empty `SESSION_ID` is an explicit admission block, not an silent skip. Scrub-only uses the same fail-open capture discipline as full publish so the driver always reaches final-summary render.

## Edge cases

- `SESSION_ID` empty: rename/scrub/publish/marker skipped; `ADMISSION_READY=false`, `ADMISSION_BLOCK_REASON=session-id-missing`.
- Rename no-op: `ADMISSION_READY=true`, `RENAME_NOOP=true`, export `DESIGN_PUBLISH_RENAME_NOOP=true`.
- Rename failure/unknown: admission blocked until fixed.
- Scrub-only failure after rename: full flush skipped; admission remains ready; log recovery via direct `design-log-publish.sh` rerun.
- Scrub-only non-zero exit under `set -e`: captured via `set +e`; driver continues to render.
- Publish failure after admission: `[DESIGNED]` remains; `/implement` may proceed.
- Secret redactions with `SCRUB_OK=true`: immediate SECURITY diagnostic before full flush; deduped final WARN.
- Marker remains publish-gated.
- Post-`[DESIGNED]` scrub recovery: do not instruct rerunning full `/design` Step 5c as the default path.

## Failure modes

1. Scrub accidentally gates rename — violates feature. Signal: ordering tests.
2. Full flush runs after `SCRUB_OK=false` — contradictory state. Signal: publish harness single-call assertion.
3. Step 5c parser drops new keys — Step 5d/footer wrong. Signal: parser/admission tests.
4. Step 5c item 6 still couples rename to `PUBLISH_OK` — operator mis-routing. Signal: structure grep + SKILL item 6 anchor.
5. Render reads result env too early — stale admission notes. Signal: render export tests.
6. `RENAMED=false` misclassified without `RENAME_NOOP` — false operator recovery. Signal: no-op export/render tests.
7. Scrub-only has push/PR side effects — security regression. Signal: direct scrub-only test.
8. Scrub-only aborts driver under `set -e` — missing final summary. Signal: capture-pattern grep + integration test.
9. Empty `SESSION_ID` leaves admission ambiguous — false continue footer. Signal: session-id-missing test.
10. Scrub-failed guidance dead-ends after `[DESIGNED]` — unusable recovery. Signal: render/Step 5d prose review.

